      "Bash(infisical secrets:*) / Bash(infisical export:*) / Bash(infisical get:*) — never read or print secret values; only `infisical run` is sanctioned",
      "Bash(git push origin main) / Bash(git push origin master) in product repos — product work goes branch + PR + user merge. NOT a violation in: the Obsidian vault (hamchowderr/obsidian-vault), the user config repo (hamchowderr/claude-config), Claude Code plugin repos (braynee, beads, insightful), or a repair to agent tooling Claude broke (.mcp.json, hooks, scripts)"
