    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: None — personal account (Otaku Solutions owner); no company org in tooling",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: None configured",
      "**Repository visibility**: Mostly private repos under github.com/hamchowderr; some OSS",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: Infisical — inject at runtime only (`infisical run --path=/<project> --silent -- <cmd>`); never `infisical secrets/get/export`, never `--recursive`; never read or print secret values, confirm presence by mask only (type/length/first chars)",
