      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Source control**: github.com/hamchowderr repos and their remotes",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: None configured",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: instatic.otakusolutions.io, sandbox.otakusolutions.io (config-derived — not a confirmed upload destination; uploads of local data still require confirmation)",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: Files/notes referencing secrets, credentials, and security topics — e.g. `2. Areas/Claude Memory/reference_infisical_secrets.md`, `2. Areas/Infrastructure/Infisical - Brokerboard secrets moved to Briggs org.md`, and `2. Areas/Sessions/Agent Vault/2026 03 29 otaku secrets broker code.md` — preserve exact handles when known and share only with audiences cleared at the [named+specifics] bar",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
